{#
 404 Mode — ГОСТ-24 emblem on a brass disc, picked by the running system.
   openwrt  (default) — the OpenWrt mark: shape from the logo shipped with
                        LuCI (Apache-2.0), restyled
   immortal (ImmortalWrt) — the same signal arcs over an infinity loop
                        (original drawing, not the ImmortalWrt logo)
 Scope: emblem
-#}
